Description: Wireless CarPlay receiver for rootless jailbreaks
 This Showcase fork focuses on the iPhone 13 Pro running iOS 15.0.2 with
 Dopamine. The package uses the rootless layout under /var/jb.
 .
 The first release includes persistent settings, reversed landscape,
 notch clearance, edge touch handling, and connection recovery fixes.
